  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 468417335296
    m_Localized: How to Move
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 840628260864
    m_Localized: Use {0} to move around
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11425424166912
    m_Localized: How to Look
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11501731139584
    m_Localized: Use {0} to look around
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11606257389568
    m_Localized: How to Interact
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11665631956992
    m_Localized: Press {0} while looking at an item to pick it up. Try it on a clam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11983094632448
    m_Localized: How to Eat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12033615024128
    m_Localized: To relieve hunger, you need to eat. You can eat any creature by holding {0} while holding it. Try it on a clam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12559287144448
    m_Localized: How to Sell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12615385960448
    m_Localized: To earn cash, you need to sell items. Grab a clam, head to the NPC, and hold {0} to throw the clam into the shopkeeper's mouth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13093985406976
    m_Localized: How to Buy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13151384457216
    m_Localized: Head to the store and buy a crab-fishing rod by pressing {0}. Then you'll be able to catch more valuable creatures
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13829691494400
    m_Localized: How to Fish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13887153459200
    m_Localized: Look towards water and cast the bait into the ocean with {0} to catch fish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16702143811584
    m_Localized: How to Kill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16764735410176
    m_Localized: When a creature has taken the bait, reel it in with {0}, then press {1} to drop it. Then unequip what you're holding with {2}, and start punching with {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19296991924224
    m_Localized: How to Talk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19347520704512
    m_Localized: Complete quests from NPCs around the island to progress. Look at one of them and press {0} to see what they want
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19682171637760
    m_Localized: Well done, you finished the tutorial. You can now go do what you want
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375435319398400
    m_Localized: How to Think
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 375486284386304
    m_Localized: You might forget what creatures you've already caught. Try thinking by pressing {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2194092836081664
    m_Localized: How to Inspect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2194499327053824
    m_Localized: To inspect an item, press {0} while holding it. Try it on a creature to find out its value
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
